<TITLE>Side Airbag Sensor</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>The side airbag sensors are mounted at the bottom of the B pillars.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The side airbag sensor at the bottom of the B pillar consists of a semiconductor type G sensor, a communication circuit, etc.; it detects an impact from the side and sends an ignition signal to the center airbag sensor (computer), which determines operation of the SRS side airbag.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
